  <h2>Single vs multi-split — which do you need?</h2>
  <p>If you want to cool more than one room, a multi-split system runs several indoor units off one outdoor unit, so you're not cluttering the outside of the building with separate units for every room. It's a common choice for larger Copmanthorpe homes and for small premises with more than one space to cool.</p>
  <p>See our <a href="/air-conditioning-split-systems-copmanthorpe/">Single &amp; Multi-Split Air Conditioning</a> page for the full breakdown.</p>

